C_CCS","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_MTL_MC_CCS","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_MTL_RC_CCS_CC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_LNL_CCS","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::I915_FORMAT_MOD_4_TILED_BMG_CCS"],"text":"Intel tilings cover X, Y, Yf, compression variants, Gen12 render/media compression with/without clear color, and 4-tile for DG2, MTL, LNL, BMG."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BLOCK_SIZE_MASK","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BLOCK_SIZE_16x16","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BLOCK_SIZE_32x8","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BLOCK_SIZE_64x4","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BLOCK_SIZE_32x8_64x4","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_YTR","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_SPLIT","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_SPARSE","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_CBR","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_TILED","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_SC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_DB","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_BCH","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AFBC_FORMAT_MOD_USM"],"text":"AFBC uses low nibble for superblock geometry with named sizes and nine flags for transform, split, sparse, CBR, tiled, SC, DB, BCH, USM."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::_DRM_MODE_H","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_CONNECTOR_NAME_LEN","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_DISPLAY_MODE_LEN","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_PROP_NAME_LEN","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_BUILTIN","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_CLOCK_C","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_CRTC_C","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_PREFERRED","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_DEFAULT","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_USERDEF","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_DRIVER","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_TYPE_ALL"],"text":"Connector, mode, property names are 32 chars. Mode origins flag builtin, clock/CRTC computed, preferred, default, user, driver with selectable mask."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_RESERVED","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::fourcc_mod_get_vendor","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::__fourcc_mod_broadcom_param_shift","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_CODE","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::AMD_FMT_MOD"],"text":"Payload values overlap across vendors and generations; isolate vendor byte or type before interpreting low bits and mask parameters before compare."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_FLAG_PHSYNC","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_FLAG_3D_MASK","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PICTURE_ASPECT_NONE","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_CONTENT_TYPE_NO_DATA","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_FLAG_PIC_AR_MASK"],"text":"Mode flags encode H/V polarity, interlace, doublescan, composite variants, skew, double/half clock, 5-bit 3D layout zero to eight, aspect/content enums with masks."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_DPMS_ON","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_SCALE_NONE","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_DITHERING_OFF","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_DIRTY_OFF","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_LINK_STATUS_GOOD","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PANEL_TYPE_UNKNOWN","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_ROTATE_0","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_ROTATE_MASK","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_REFLECT_X","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_REFLECT_MASK","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_CONTENT_PROTECTION_UNDESIRED"],"text":"Power, scaling, dithering, dirty, link, panel use small codes. Rotation uses bits 0-3 and reflect bits 4-5 with separate masks. Protection is undesired/desired/enabled."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_plane","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_subconnector","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_connector","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PROP_LEGACY_TYPE","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PROP_EXTENDED_TYPE","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PROP_ATOMIC","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_property"],"text":"Encoders run none to DPI zero to eight; connectors unknown to USB zero to twenty; subconnectors use sparse values. Properties combine legacy bits with extended object/signed-range types and atomic bit."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_FLAG_PHSYNC","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_plane","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_connector","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::DRM_MODE_PROP_EXTENDED_TYPE","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_cursor"],"text":"Broadcast and pixel-multiplex bits, pending property bit, and never-used gamma/modifier-free paths are obsolete. Extended/atomic bits alter legacy meaning; color matrices are sign-magnitude."}],"invariants":[{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FOURCC_H","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::fourcc_code"],"text":"Fourcc header is idempotent via guard. Codes pack four bytes little-endian into u32 with shifts 0,8,16,24."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_RESERVED","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::fourcc_mod_get_vendor","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::fourcc_mod_code"],"text":"Modifier keeps vendor in top byte and data in low 56 bits; constructor masks payload and reserved sets all payload bits."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_CODE","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_TYPE_AFBC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_TYPE_MISC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_AFBC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_TYPE_AFRC","include/uapi/drm/drm_fourcc.h::DRM_FORMAT_MOD_ARM_AFRC"],"text":"ARM encodes type in high payload bits with masked value; wrappers inject AFBC, fixed-rate, or misc tiling types."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_modeinfo","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_plane","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_connector","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_property"],"text":"Enumeration uses count plus address with names as stable keys; connector identity is kind plus per-kind number; CRTC compat is index bitmask; source crop is fixed-point."}],"locks":[],"pass":1,"phase_map":[{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p14","crown":"A","phase":"F0"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F1"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F2"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p05","crown":"A","phase":"F3"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p05","crown":"A","phase":"F4"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p10","crown":"A","phase":"F5"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p13","crown":"A","phase":"F6"}],"schema":"lx.dossier.v1","state_machines":[],"structs":[{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_modeinfo"],"text":"Mode holds clock, H/V timings, skew, scan, refresh, flags, type, name. Resources return id array addresses with counts and min/max size. CRTC setup carries connector list, ids, position, gamma size, valid flag, timing."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_set_plane","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_plane"],"text":"Plane request carries plane, CRTC, fb ids, flags, signed dest origin with unsigned dest size, unsigned fixed-point source rect. Query returns CRTC/fb ids, CRTC mask, unused gamma, format count and address excluding modifier formats."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_plane","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_connector"],"text":"Encoder query reports encoder/CRTC ids, kind, CRTC and clone masks. Connector query carries encoder/mode/property addresses and counts, current encoder, ids, kind, instance, connection, size mm, subpixel, pad. Instance is per-kind unique, order unstable."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_property_enum","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_property"],"text":"Property enum pairs value with name. Property query gives value/enum addresses, id, flags, name, counts. Object access uses id/value arrays; connector writes and blob access have dedicated forms."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_get_property","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_fb_cmd2","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_fb_dirty_cmd"],"text":"Legacy fb create holds id, size, pitch, bpp, depth, handle. Extended holds id, size, fourcc, flags, four planes of handle/pitch/offset/modifier; interlace and modifier bits gate use and planes share one modifier. Dirty carries fb id, flags, color, clips; attach pairs connector with timing."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_mode_cursor","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_color_lut32","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_plane_size_hint"],"text":"Cursor carries flags, CRTC, signed pos, size, handle; extended adds hotspot. Gamma carries CRTC, size, RGB addresses. Color uses 9/12 sign-magnitude matrices. LUT packs RGB plus reserved in 16/32-bit; 16-bit spans zero to full. Hint holds w/h."},{"sids":["include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_colorop_type","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_colorop_lut3d_interpolation_type","include/uapi/drm/drm_mode.h::drm_colorop_lut1d_interpolation_type"],"text":"Color ops enumerate per-channel curve, 1D u32 LUT, 3x4 matrix, fixed-point multiplier, 3D u32 LUT. Payloads are driver-sized blobs; cubic tables traverse red fastest then green then blue. Interpolation is tetrahedral for 3D and linear for 1D."}],"stubs":[]}
